    "title": "Exchange Club Of Greeneville Concludes Nearly A Century Of Community Service - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bobby Rader ,\n20 hours ago GREENEVILLE, Tenn. — After nearly 97 years of service to Greene County, the Exchange Club of Greeneville officially concluded operations on Tuesday, June 30th. The decision to disband was approved by club members following several years of declining membership and volunteer participation. While the decision was difficult, members determined that the club no longer had the resources necessary to continue fulfilling its mission effectively. Read full article",
